Checkout (Ch 46) calls it and reacts to its events through the outbox (Ch 13).

99
00:07:17.584 --> 00:07:18.907
Learning objectives.

100
00:07:19.187 --> 00:07:21.085
By the end you will be able to:

101
00:07:21.365 --> 00:07:27.168
Model money as a double-entry, append-only ledger with correct concurrency control (L1).

